Examples:
Why do you want to work in telesales?
Are you comfortable making outbound calls every day?
Yes
No
Do you have access to a smartphone?
Yes
No
Do you have reliable internet access?
Yes
No
When can you start?
Immediately
Within 1 week
Within 2 weeks
More than 2 weeks
Preferred working arrangement
Remote
On-site
Hybrid
Any
Documents
Optional:
CV / Resume upload
