25. User Experience Requirements
Mobile First
The candidate experience must be designed primarily for smartphones.
Requirements:
Large form controls.
Clear typography.
Minimal typing.
Dropdowns where appropriate.
Large Apply/Continue buttons.
Fast page loading.
Progress indicator for multi-step forms.
Form data should not disappear if the user accidentally refreshes the page where practical.
Suggested application form steps:
Step 1 — Personal Information
Step 2 — Location
Step 3 — Experience
Step 4 — Assessment
Step 5 — Review & Submit

26. Design Direction
The portal should feel:
Modern
Clean
Professional
Friendly
Mobile-first
Simple
Avoid complicated HR software interfaces.
Candidate pages should have generous spacing, strong headings, clear cards and simple calls to action.
Admin screens should prioritize information density and speed.

