28. Security Requirements
The system contains candidate personal information.
Minimum security requirements:
Admin routes require authentication.
Applicants cannot access other applicant records.
CV files should not be publicly enumerable.
Validate all form input server-side.
Restrict uploaded file types and sizes.
Protect against duplicate/spam submissions.
Store passwords securely if password authentication is used.
Use HTTPS in production.
Maintain a basic audit trail of recruitment stage changes.

29. Duplicate Application Handling
Before creating a completed application, check:
Email address
Phone number
If an existing application exists for the same active recruitment campaign, warn the candidate rather than creating multiple records.
Admin may still manually allow duplicates where necessary.

