31. V1 Scope
The first release should focus only on:
Public telesales recruitment page.
Job information.
Mobile application form.
Application submission.
Incomplete application tracking.
Admin authentication.
Applicant dashboard.
Applicant search and filtering.
Applicant profiles.
Recruitment stages.
Interview scheduling.
Interview attendance.
Email notifications.
WhatsApp notifications.
Job settings.
Basic recruitment analytics.

32. Out of Scope for V1
Do NOT build the following unless specifically requested later:
Employee onboarding.
Payroll.
Attendance management.
Employee HR records.
Leave management.
Performance management.
Background checks.
Complex interview scoring systems.
Multiple HR departments.
Applicant login/password accounts.
Full applicant tracking system features.
AI candidate ranking.
Video interviews.
Complex calendar integrations.
The goal is recruitment simplicity.

