34. Acceptance Criteria
The V1 product is considered complete when:
A candidate can view the telesales role on a mobile device.
Salary, commission and employment terms are clearly visible.
A candidate can complete and submit an application.
Started but incomplete applications can be counted.
Completed applications appear immediately on the admin dashboard.
Admin can search applicants.
Admin can filter applicants by state and country.
Admin can open and review an applicant.
Admin can move applicants between recruitment stages.
Admin can schedule an interview.
Candidate receives an interview notification through email.
Candidate can receive an interview notification through WhatsApp when the WhatsApp integration is enabled.
Admin can mark interview attendance.
Admin can mark a candidate as recruited.
Admin can reject a candidate.
Dashboard shows recruitment funnel statistics.
Dashboard shows applicants grouped by state.
Salary, commission and job terms can be changed without changing the source code.
Candidate-facing pages are fully usable on mobile phones.

35. Product Principle
The main principle for this product is:
Every action required to recruit a telesales representative should be achievable in a few clicks.
Do not build a complicated ATS.
The application should primarily help the recruitment team answer four questions:
Who applied?
Who should we interview?
Who attended the interview?
Who did we recruit?
